Recovery Directorate production repair for P1 #147, based directly on canonical BLACK SKY main `2ce97af4bafa05db3dbeec3a83320186ea06a956`.

Defect reproduced against `RevenueEngine.handleLemonWebhook()`: the signed provider order witness was persisted before classification/economic consequences. A crash after that first durable write caused exact redelivery to hit dedupe and return `DUPLICATE`, permanently swallowing a cleared payment or reversal whose logical internal effect never completed.

Repair on head `a7f73c57a3bd47bd383a780785949326bc68f612` keeps dedupe but makes it completion-aware:

- verified order witness persists first and carries `processingStatus: received`;
- matching incomplete witness => `RESUME` missing internal stages only;
- classification + lead/revenue/subscription/notification consequences + terminal order marker execute in one serialized transaction;
- PostgreSQL locks the exact order row and uses a per-lead transaction advisory lock before economic mutation;
